      {
       "_key": "b58d3ca94684",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Launched as Google Ventures in 2009, GV oversees more than $13 billion in assets under management. Our operating partners support founding teams at every stage of company-building across executive talent, communications, and marketing. GV is a non-strategic venture capital firm that invests independently from its sole limited partner, Alphabet. We connect startups with Google and Alphabet companies, providing unique access to the world's best technology and talent."
      }
